Type: <b>Bug</b>

Create a Vite 8 frontend with MSAL v5 integration. Configure it with an Entra ID app registration.

The Integrated Browser in VS Code correctly shows the main page, but has an issue displaying the popup that is shown when clicking the login button.
External browsers do not have this issue.

| Integrated browser | Edge |
|---|---|
| <img width="1325" height="960" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6e4673a0-2fe3-47b2-a4a3-609f36a37695" /> | <img width="633" height="532" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a7f93d0-6d53-4f9c-bc67-1946e0ee6a12" /> |

Observations:
- No errors in the Console (in the developer tools) of the main page nor in the Console of the popup
- The Integrated Browser popup does not allow me to click previous or next, it looks as if there has been no navigation.
- The developer tools of the popup shows a chrome issue, but manually navigating to login.microsoftonline.com first does not solve this issue.
> Chrome may soon delete state for intermediate websites in a recent navigation chain

<img width="1136" height="367" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c693dff5-7ab5-4223-af39-39e68057ee16" />

